Ahsoka Season 2 Trailer Reaction @ D23 — Anakin Returns! | Star Wars
The Ahsoka Season 2 trailer just dropped at at D23: The Ultimate Disney Fan Event — and we're not okay. Anakin Skywalker is back, Thrawn is rallying the Imperial remnant, and the stakes have never felt higher. Watch our full reaction as we break down every moment, easter egg, and what it means for the galaxy far, far away.

Ahsoka Season 2 premieres January 20, 2027 on Disney+.

Let us know in the comments what you're most excited (or terrified) for.

